    "description": "Cottage, level 2 of 3: L1 plus flourish 2. Timber cottage: cobblestone base, oak plank walls between upright spruce posts, two-tone spruce and dark oak gable roof with jettied gables, brick chimney; bed, chest, hearth inside. Not yet builder-tested: azure_bluet, dandelion.",
    "changes": "The roof is now two-tone (dark oak eaves and gable edges, spruce between) and overhangs the gables with upside-down stair trim; the pale gable squares are real windows with sills; the lone fence inside is gone (the table is a barrel); L1 gets shutters and lantern posts, L2 adds window boxes with flowers on three sides and a front fence, and L3 adds a covered woodshed on the right side with a stacked woodpile and a lantern.",
